# Dataset Documentation

## Dataset Overview

This project uses the **Indian Tech Job Market 2026 | 23K+ Records** dataset from Kaggle to explore hiring trends relevant to Data Analyst roles in India.

- **Source:** [Kaggle – Indian Tech Job Market 2026](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/shree0910/india-tech-job-market-2026-23k-records)
- **Original data context:** The dataset description identifies the listings as a snapshot scraped from Naukri.com on June 10, 2025.
- **Reported size:** 23,201 job listings and 32 columns, as stated in the dataset description.
- **File downloaded:** `indian_tech_jobs_2026.csv`
- **Reported license:** CC BY-SA 4.0. Permissions relating to the underlying scraped listings should be verified before redistributing the raw data.

## Analysis Objectives

The analysis will investigate:

- Most requested skills for Data Analyst roles
- Job opportunities by location
- Experience requirements
- Salary disclosure and salary trends
- Work-mode preferences, where available in the dataset

## Data Validation

Before analysis, the dataset will be checked for:

- Missing values
- Duplicate records and job IDs
- Inconsistent job titles and categories
- Invalid or inconsistent salary and experience values
- Unexpected values in key columns

## Data Sharing Note

The raw CSV is kept locally while redistribution permissions are reviewed. This repository will document the source and publish analysis code and permitted aggregate findings.

## Findings

Results will be added after the dataset has been inspected, cleaned, and analyzed. No findings are assumed in advance.
